cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ActiMotus Validation — Reproducibility Package"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Heidler
    given-names: Josef
    email: heidlerjosef@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/actimotus/actimotus-validation"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21955041"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-15"
abstract: >-
  Reproduces the validation of the ActiMotus human activity recognition
  algorithm against video ground truth on five public accelerometry datasets
  covering children, adults and older adults. Three scripts regenerate every
  table and confusion matrix in the study from data fetched at pinned
  HuggingFace revisions and an ActiMotus release installed from PyPI.
keywords:
  - accelerometry
  - human activity recognition
  - physical behaviour
  - validation
  - reproducibility
